herolte: herocycle test schedule, black-pixel count, DECON stop only after the fade (0458, D-0096)

min88 (E-0305): the one-step DECON stop works (372/366 mA against 519-535) but the Director saw the lock screen text and the dock with the screen "off". herocycle=<s>: 150 s after the power thread starts, three times, the screen goes off for <s> s and on for 20 s through herolte_fb_power (the same state change as RequestPowerChange; iOS is not told), so a test needs no finger. When the fade-out ends, SweetFramebuffer counts the pixels that are not black once and logs "HEROLTE FB: fade done, N of M pixels not black", and sets herolte_fb_dark; herodisp stops the DECON only when that flag is set. Nothing changes without herocycle/herodisp.

